om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/b9e2a7d19d02f5b29b7afb75395ea178.webm?t=1748979345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529530/extras/b9e2a7d19d02f5b29b7afb75395ea178.mp4?t=1748979345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
